\label{lemma-regular-gorenstein}
A regular local ring is Gorenstein.
A regular ring is Gorenstein.

\label{lemma-characterize-gorenstein}
Let $A$ be a Noetherian ring. The following are equivalent
\begin{enumerate}
\item $A$ has finite injective dimension as a module over itself,
\item $A$ is Gorenstein and finite dimensional.
\end{enumerate}
In this case $A[0]$ is a dualizing complex.

